                               (Z_to_bv 64 (beg + 8 * nsh n)) x19 x20 (Z_to_bv 64 (beg + n)) s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 x28 x29 x30 x31)
                           F (Z_to_bv 64 0xbc96c) fc None mm (seg_rom asegs)).
